dotnet10 (10.0.100-10.0.0~rc1-0ubuntu1~24.04.1~ppa1) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release
  * d/control, d/rules: remove package netstandard-targeting-pack-2.1-10.0:
    Upstream removed this package, see: https://github.com/dotnet/sdk/pull/50354.

    IMPORTANT: If you had previous preview version of the `dotnet10` package
    installed and have installed one of the following packages: `dotnet9`,
    `dotnet8`, `dotnet7` or `dotnet6`, we recommend to reinstall these packages.
    Otherwise the .NET standard 2.1 targeting pack package will not receive any
    updates.

  * d/p/0002-roslyn-analyzers-dont-use-apphost.patch: roslyn-analyzers don't get
    built anymore, see: https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet/pull/1979
  * d/rules: add `--branding default` to DOTNET_BUILD_ARGS, see also:
    https://github.com/dotnet/source-build/issues/5337
  * d/rules: remove uninstalled netstandard-targeting-pack-2.1-10.0 files

